                <pb facs="0108" n="16" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg16"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Aaron Kenig to the
                            Legation.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bremen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I notify you es I am going horn to
                    Hartford conn, Amerika tomorrow the 15th and I giff mine case in your hands. The
                    imont of money is 410 00/100 Gulden 50 Mark 25 pfenings one Rubel 85¢ Amerikan
                    money all the ansver witch you will hev to ansver me please send to Hartford
                    conn, yours trouly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aaron Kenig.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
